  "prefLabel": "He-P 901.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 901.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to establish requirements for appointment, duties, and training of town health officers in the state of New Hampshire. This chapter does not apply to cities pursuant to RSA 128:7.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for He-P 900) #13604, eff 3-28-23",
